Date: Fri, 20 Nov 2026 23:58:36 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 3/7] test-posix: Check the System V IPC headers

Types, structure members, constants and prototypes of <sys/ipc.h>,
<sys/msg.h>, <sys/sem.h> and <sys/shm.h>, including SHM_FAILED.
